        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2013, Wall Mounted Tooth Brush Holder With Frosted Glass</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen mounted to the wall, this toothbrush tumbler will make a lovely and functional accessory to any bathroom. The timeless appeal of the R-Series Tumbler Set can be found both in the traditional wall mount with concealed screws and in the beautiful finishes in which it is available. The bracket and rose are made of solid brass and the cup is made of frosted glass. Made with the attention to quality Deltana is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2013-specifications.gif?v=1704354783\" width=\"579\" height=\"217\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2013 Tooth Brush Holder with Glass Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R-Series Classic Tooth Brush Caddy:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass wall mount with a glass cup.</li>\r\n<li>Cup Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cup Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2013.pdf?v=1704262291\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2013 Tooth Brush Holder with Glass Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 tooth brush holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
